OL,3,GNEWSAThey've been handed #20m - but can
OL,4,Ait really change lives?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf someone handed your neighbourhood
OL,7,F#20m, what would you spend it on?
OL,9,FThat is the question facing residents
OL,10,Fin two communities in the West Country
OL,11,Fafter they were each awarded #20m
OL,12,Fthrough the government's Pride in Place
OL,13,Fprogramme.
OL,15,FThe money could be used to improve
OL,16,Feverything from youth services and
OL,17,Fgreen spaces to skills training and
OL,18,Fcommunity projects.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
