OL,3,GNEWSAThey've been handed #20m - but can
OL,4,Ait really change lives?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut for many residents in Bridgwater in
OL,7,FSomerset and Hartcliffe in Bristol, the
OL,8,Fbigger question is whether millions of
OL,9,Fpounds of investment can deliver
OL,10,Flasting change.
